### Prijava administratora (Login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ariana",
  "password": "grande"
}

> {%
    // Ova skripta hvata token iz JSON odgovora i čuva ga pod imenom "auth_token"
    client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.token);
%}

### 2. GET Nastavnici (pusti ovo drugo)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/nastavnici
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### 3. POST dodavanje literature
POST http://localhost:8080/api/literatura/create
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "naslov": "Uvod u programiranje",
  "autori": "Marko Marković",
  "godinaIzdanja": 2021,
  "izdavac": "Akademska misao"
}

### 4. POST studijski program
POST http://localhost:8080/api/sp/create
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
